  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.2a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAs">IV As</ref> 6.2a</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="6.2a" corresp="#wit-h-frag">⁊ gif he ealderman oððe abbud oþþe ðegen sece, hæbbe ðreora nihta fyrst.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#attenborough" n="6.2" corresp="#wit-h-frag">⁊ gif he ealderman oððe abbud oþþe ðegen sece, hæbbe ðeora nihta fyrst.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h-frag">If he flees to an <hi rend="italic">ealdorman</hi>, or an abbot or a thegn, he shall have a respite of three days.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und wenn er einen Ealdorman oder Abt oder Thegn aufsucht, habe er 3 Tage Frist.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And if he seeks out an ealdorman or abbot or thegn, let him have 3 days' respite.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
